<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Energen cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Energen cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jeffries &amp; Co said Wednesday it lowered its rating on Energen Corp to a hold from an accumulate because the stock had reached its price target.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Lawrence Crowley said in a research note: &quot;Energen's success in growing its exploration and production subsidiary, Taurus Exploration, has resulted in Energen's stock moving from a 15 percent earnings discount to its peer group to a 12 percent premium.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Energen's shares were off 1/2 at 34-1/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
